OL,3,GNEWSABeverley Knight in BBC Proms Dolly
OL,4,AParton tribute
OL,5,
OL,6,FWolverhampton singer Beverley Knight is
OL,7,Fto perform one of Dolly Parton's
OL,8,Fbest-known songs at this year's Last
OL,9,FNight of the Proms.
OL,11,FKnight will sing I Will Always Love You
OL,12,Fas part of To Dolly, With Love, a
OL,13,Ftribute to the late country music star
OL,14,Fat the Royal Albert Hall on Saturday.
OL,16,FThe medley, arranged by Fiona Bryce,
OL,17,Falso features Sheridan Smith performing
OL,18,F9 to 5 and country-pop duo Ward Thomas
OL,19,Fsinging Jolene.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
