OL,3,GNEWSABeverley Knight in BBC Proms Dolly
OL,4,AParton tribute
OL,5,
OL,6,FParton died in August having had a
OL,7,Fseven-decade career gaining 10 Grammy
OL,8,Fawards and selling more than 100
OL,9,Fmillion records worldwide. She was also
OL,10,Fknown for her humanitarian work.
